{title: Aankhon Mein Teri}
{artist: Om Shanti Om K K}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]aankhon mein teri,        [A]ajab si ajab si adayein hain...
[A]aankhon mein teri,        [A]ajab si ajab si adayein hain...
[F]dil ko banade jo [G]patang,        saanse ye [A]teri wo hawaye hai
[A]aayee aisi [D]raat hai jo,        [F]bahot khushna [A]seeb hai
[A]chahe jise [F#m]door se duniya,        [F]wo mere [A]kareeb hai
[A]kitna kuch [F#m]kehna hai phir,        bhi hai dil me sawaal [A]kahin...
[A]sapno mein jo [F#m]roz kaha hai,        wo phir se kahun ya [E]nahi....
[A]aankhon mein teri ajab si,        ajab si adayein hain...
[A]tere saath [D]saath,        aisa, [F]koi noor [A]aaya hai
[A]chand teri [D]roshni ka,        [F]halka sa ek [A]saaya hai
[A]teri nazro ne [F#m]dil ka kiya,        jo hashar, asar ye huaaaa.. [A]
[A]ab in me hi [F#m]doob ke ho,        jao paar, yehi hai [E]duaaa...
[A]aankhon mein teri ajab si,        ajab si adayein hain...
[A]aankhon mein teri ajab,        si ajab si adayein hain...
[F]dil ko banade jo [G]patang,        saanse ye [A]teri wo hawaye hai
